{"overview":"Adonese is returning home from seeing the woman he is courting, and he is driving around a corner when his car accidentally brushes against the tramp 'Faithful' and knocks him over. Feeling sorry for him, Adonese helps him up and buys him a new suit of clothes. The naively innocent Faithful reads too much into this gesture, and he begins to follow his benefactor everywhere, expecting to receive future gifts.","tagline":"","cast":[{"n":"Arthur V. Johnson","c":"John Dobbs [Adonese]","p":"/lmhYKDRrZeqcZg7FQUmyEoLLqoo.jpg","q":"Q661079"},{"n":"Mack Sennett","c":"Zeke [Faithful]","p":"/24XTSL0AbuT6gzjqAFhpc4fkEts.jpg","q":"Q317574"},{"n":"Florence Barker","c":"John's Sweetheart","p":"/9UBRj7K9xRDyGkNvGxE8Jdwv22S.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Kate Bruce","c":"John's Sweetheart's Mother","p":"/oLC99DsB0gkPdsZJRi0d1D1B4hD.jpg","q":"Q2461823"},{"n":"Frank Powell","c":"The Butler","p":"/204pUG69Va4HRbuReZ21IEVxWMV.jpg","q":"Q523961"},{"n":"Billy Quirk","c":"Neighbor","p":"/mVRHKE8gPNB3b3BEKIZ1rAj0W4f.jpg","q":"Q2903704"},{"n":"Francis J. Grandon","c":"Neighbor","p":"/dFummCUA17pUE42wVPD9d2PHesS.jpg","q":"Q3750930"},{"n":"Dell Henderson","c":"Bystander","p":"/gA4BPbRHPSvI16n1QcRlAd3gmSo.jpg","q":"Q3021715"},{"n":"W. Chrystie Miller","c":"Neighbor","p":"/kEDCliujwHUyk8awGehzfybQzzC.jpg","q":"Q2474062"},{"n":"Anthony O'Sullivan","c":"Bystander / Neighbor","p":null,"q":"Q3618522"}],"country":["United States"],"language":[],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Faithful_(1910_film)","qid":"Q3738487"}